WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.080
Scrabble is not just
a simple word game,

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.800
it requires strategy

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.680
and an understanding of
mathematics and probability.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.520
Here are five tips
to improve your game.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.920
There are 124 two-letter words
allowed in Scrabble.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:28.560
Try to learn as many of them
as you can -

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.800
even if they look a bit weird.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.640
Then play them parallel to your
opponent's word to score big points.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:47.840
If you play all seven letters in one
turn, you get an extra 50 points.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.240
How can you improve your chances

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.280
of getting a bonus?

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:55.600
Keep good combinations of
one-point tiles on your rack,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.080
especially those in the word...

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.360
These six letters go with
every letter of the alphabet

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:06.200
except for Q and Y,
to make a seven-letter word.

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:19.560
A hook is a letter that can be added
to the front or end

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.760
of a word to make a new one.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.200
S is the most obvious.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:27.480
But there are many less obvious ones
you can use to surprise your opponent

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.120
with a high-scoring play.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.440
Practice anagramming
whenever you can.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.800
Cryptic crosswords
and puzzles can help.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:58.000
Sometimes normal words
can be surprisingly hard to spot.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:18.000
Don't be frightened to exchange
some or all of your tiles

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:19.400
rather than playing a word.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:21.320
It can be the best thing to do.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.200
High-scoring tiles
are not always good.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.360
From an opening rack like this, there
is nothing you can usefully play.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:33.560
Exchange six tiles
and just keep the letter E.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:37.480
Ah now that looks a lot better!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.360
Follow these tips and you'll
find yourself winning

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:42.960
a lot more than you lose.

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:48.000
Even though it certainly feels great,
winning isn't everything,

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.240
don't forget to have fun.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:03:00.720
Thanks for watching. 
Don’t forget to subscribe! :)

